Intel iGPU bound to the xe driver at 0000:00:02.0 + NVIDIA dGPU at 01:00.0
behind root port 00:01.0, on Plasma 6.7.5, whose ksystemstats can't read xe.
The Intel GPU is left out, but it still takes a PCI index as it does in
ksystemstats; the dGPU sorts first in libudev's sysfs path order, so it is
gpu0. Borrows the desktop's procfs and DMI data.
